    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO OPERATION SIEGE</strong></h2>Operation Siege is an online multiplayer tactical FPS based on air combat, ground combat, with a selection of realistic faction-specific weapons and vehicles allow players to build their own loadout for their preferred tactics. Experience the war by being a commander and perform airstrike operations to eliminate the enemy team and supply your team with various of supply kits. <br><br><br>Explore six massive maps with the traditional game modes Conquest, Team Deathmatch, Rush, and lastly special game mode Operation Siege.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Play to your strengths</strong> \u2014 With 4 classes: Assault, Engineer, Support, Recon \u2014 each have the specialties.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Hit the battlefield with up to 64 players</strong>  \u2014  By featuring two armies US Force, Russia Force. \u2014 With upcoming Forces in the future.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customize your loadout</strong> \u2014 With a selection of faction-specific weapons and vehicles for your preferred tactics.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore the environments with variation of game modes</strong> \u2014 By actions divided into main objectives.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Be the commander</strong> \u2014 And help your team by performing airstrike operations and supplying your team with a various of supply kits.</li></ul>",
